additional_info.body:
A CPO in Türkiye started using Monta as a backend.
After scanning the RFID card in the Authorize step,
OCPP: Received command: DataTransfer (d369a773-94a9-4df7-879c-d7774fbd3767) - {"vendorId":"TariffInformation","messageId":"SetUserPrice","data":"{\"idTag\":\"F0F07CFDFECBC7\",\"price\":{\"en\":\"9.99 TRY/kWh\",\"de\":\"9,99 TRY/kWh\",\"fr\":\"9,99 TRY/kWh\",\"da\":\"9,99 TRY/kWh\"}}"}
OCPP: Send result: DataTransfer (d369a773-94a9-4df7-879c-d7774fbd3767) - {
"status":"Rejected"
}
and the charging process does not start.
Detailed Log is the attachment.
We kindly request that the issue be reviewed.
